Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HeavyFogTunnelScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Leading vehicle in tunnel" .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Following vehicle (ego) in tunnel" .

:evidence1 a :OpenDoorIndicator ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Inability to clearly see leading vehicle due to fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision due to reduced visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Adverse weather conditions affecting driving safety" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Inability to clearly see leading vehicle due to fog
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Potential rear-end collision due to reduced visibility
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 3:**
Description: Adverse weather conditions affecting driving safety
Severity Score: 0.8